{"title":"Career roadmap — Wealth Advisor","role":"Wealth Advisor","summary":"A Wealth Advisor helps individuals and families manage, preserve, and grow their wealth. The role combines investment planning, financial products, risk assessment, portfolio construction, taxation awareness, retirement planning, and client relationship management.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"Financial Markets (BFM) / Banking & Insurance (BBI)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a BFM/BBI graduate, the strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial Markets","Investment Products","Financial Planning","Portfolio Analysis","Client Advisory","Wealth Management"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Financial markets, mutual funds, insurance, financial planning, Excel, client communication"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Portfolio construction, asset allocation, taxation, retirement planning, HNI/UHNI wealth management"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Behavioural finance, alternative investments, estate planning, digital wealth platforms"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-powered wealth management, personalised portfolios, automated advisory, family-office services"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Financial markets foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Accounting"},{"text":"Financial management"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Investment fundamentals"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"h","text":"Asset classes"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Bonds"},{"text":"Fixed deposits"},{"text":"Mutual funds"},{"text":"ETFs"},{"text":"Government securitie