e advisor's value will increasingly shift toward judgement, trust, behavioural coaching, and complex financial decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Hybrid Advisory"},{"type":"p","text":"The future model will increasingly combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Human Advisor","AI","Digital Platform"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Routine portfolio monitoring can be automated while the advisor focuses on complex clients and major financial decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Behavioural Wealth Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understanding investor behaviour will become increasingly valuable."},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Loss aversion"},{"text":"Recency bias"},{"text":"Herding"},{"text":"Overconfidence"},{"text":"Anchoring"},{"text":"Risk perception"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong advisor must help clients avoid emotional investment decisions."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Family Office & Intergenerational Wealth"},{"type":"p","text":"As wealth becomes more complex, advisors may work across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment portfolios"},{"text":"Estate planning"},{"text":"Succession"},{"text":"Tax planning coordination"},{"text":"Philanthropy"},{"text":"Family governance"},{"text":"Alternative investments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This creates a premium pathway beyond retail wealth management."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Advisor","Recommend products","Manage relationships"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wealth Strategist","Understand family goals","Build diversified strategy","Use AI analytics","Manage behavioural risk","Coordinate investments, tax and succession professionals"]},{"type":"p","text":"The profession increasingly combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finance","Investments","Financial Planning","Behavioural Science","Technology","Client Advisory"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"Investments"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity"},{"text":"Bonds"},{"text":"Mutual Funds"},{"text":"ETFs"},{"text":"REITs"},{"text":"Gold"},{"text":"Alternative Investments"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial Planning"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Goal Planning"},{"text":"Retirement Planning"},{"text":"Education Planning"},{"text":"Insurance Planning"},{"text":"Cash-flow Planning"},{"text":"Tax-aware Planning"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Asset Allocation"},{"text":"Diversification"},{"text":"Rebalancing"},{"text":"Risk Profiling"},{"text":"Portfolio Monitoring"},{"text":"Performance Attribution"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Financial Modelling"},{"text":"Portfolio Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Python basics"},{"text":"SQL basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Client Skills"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Relationship Management"},{"text":"Financial Storytelling"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Behavioural Finance"},{"text":"Client Discovery"},{"text":"Presentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"NISM qualifications relevant to role"},{"text":"CFP"},{"text":"CFA"},{"text":"Regulatory awareness"},{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Suitability and fiduciary principles where applicable"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Target progression"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com BFM/BBI","Financial Markets","Investment Fundamentals"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2"},{"type":"flow","items":["Mutual Funds","Insurance","Financial Planning","Excel"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3"},{"type":"flow","items":["Portfolio Management","Asset Allocation","Power BI","Financial Modelling"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Final Year"},{"type":"flow","items":["Wealth Management Internship","Financial Planning Portfolio","Investment Projects"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"0–2 years"},{"type":"p","text":"Wealth Management Executive / Relationship Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"2–5 years"},{"type":"p","text":"Wealth Advisor / Financial Planner"},{"type":"h","text":"5–8 years"},{"type":"p","text":"Senior Wealth Manager / Private Banker"},{"type":"h","text":"8–12+ years"},{"type":"p","text":"Head of Wealth Management / Portfolio Manager / Family Office Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Best employability combination"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com BFM/BBI","Financial Planning","Investment Products","Portfolio Management","Advanced Excel","NISM qualifications","CFP/CFA pathway","client communication","wealth-management internship","portfolio-analysis skills."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For the long term, the strongest profile is investment knowledge + financial planning + behavioural finance + technology + trusted client advisory, rather than simply selling financial products."}]}]}